Package: airquality
Title: Air quality in the Canton of Zurich
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jörg", "Sintermann", , "luft@bd.zh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Systematic and comprehensive air quality data compilation, analysis and visualisation for the
    Canton of Zurich, based on public data. A targets project, not an installable package: this file is the
    dependency manifest (renv snapshot.type = "explicit"; tests/testthat/test-dependencies.R keeps it complete).
